   "subject": "plotting DMR at chromosomal scale",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I am primarily interested in plotting DMR on a chromosomal scale. I tried plotting position vs. meth.diff value but there are too many data points (even for 1kb tiling window) and does not produce informative figure. There are two important informations on the meth.diff data- 1) how dense the DMRs at a location 2) what is the level of difference on that location. Do you happen to know any way to present this this data. <div>Some publication present the DMRs as signal to noise ratio (mean methylation on test samples - mean methylation on control samples : sd of test samples + sd of control samples). Is there anywhere I can look for these informations on methylKit objects? I assume I can take meth.diff value as mean methylation on test samples - mean methylation on control samples, but I did not see how to find the standard deviations. </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance,</div><div>Milan</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "8IE5CI_46lQJ",
   "from": "Altuna Akalin",
   "author": "ab8277113f65c05e",
   "date": "2014-01-11T08:36:43Z",
   "subject": "Re: plotting DMR at chromosomal scale",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think on chromosomal scale everything will look a bit squished and uninformative if you don&#39;t have strong genome/chromsome wide signals. But if you want to get the sd of groups and do a  plot based on that, you can do that. Also default options is that the differences between means of groups are differences between weighted means, weights are coverages. <div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">Anyway, you can get the sds and means as follows<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">methMat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">percMethylation</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">methylBase</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)# methMat has the same row order as methylBase.obj<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\">library(matrixStats)<br># means and sds for the first group<br>mean0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rowMeans</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.984375px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>methMat</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.222222328186035px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">[,</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.222222328186035px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> methylBase</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">obj</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.222222328186035px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">@treament</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">==</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.222222328186035px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">]</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre\">)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:17.984375px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">sd0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rowSds</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">methMat</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> methylBase</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">@treament</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">])<br></span></span><span><br># means and sds the second group of samples<br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mean1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rowMeans</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.984375px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>methMat</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:12.222222328186035px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">[,</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:12.222222328186035px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> methylBase</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">obj</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.222222328186035px;font-weight:bold;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">@treament</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">==</span><span><font color=\"#006666\">1</font></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:12.222222328186035px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">]</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre\">)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:17.984375px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>sd1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span>rowSds</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span>methMat</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">[,</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> methylBase</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">obj</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">@treament</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">==</span><span><font color=\"#006666\">1</font></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12.222222328186035px;line-height:17.98611068725586px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">])</span></span></div><br></span></div></code></div><br></span><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><br></span></div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
